{"evaluating_the_quality_of_image_segmentation": "Evaluating the quality of image segmentation refers to the process of assessing how well an image segmentation algorithm has performed in dividing an image into meaningful segments or regions. This evaluation is crucial for determining the effectiveness and accuracy of the segmentation method used."},
