{"experiments__verify__the_effectiveness_of_classical_metrics_for_remote_sensing_and_medical_image_evaluation": "The predicate \"verify\" indicates that the experiments are designed to confirm or validate the effectiveness and reliability of certain metrics or methods used in the evaluation of image segmentation results."},
{"the_effectiveness_of_classical_metrics_for_remote_sensing_and_medical_image_evaluation": "The effectiveness of classical metrics for remote sensing and medical image evaluation refers to the capability of traditional assessment methods to accurately measure and judge the quality and performance of image segmentation in remote sensing and medical imaging applications."},
