{"according_to_zhang_1996_and_chen_et_al_2018": "The categories according to Zhang (1996) and Chen et al. (2018) refer to specific classifications of segmentation evaluation algorithms proposed by these researchers. These classifications likely include different approaches or criteria used to evaluate segmentation results."},
