{"analytical_evaluation__considers_the_performance_of_the_algorithm_based_on__theoretical_knowledge": "The predicate describes how analytical evaluation assesses the performance of algorithms. Instead of relying on empirical data, it bases its assessment on theoretical knowledge, providing a conceptual understanding of an algorithm's efficiency and effectiveness."},
