{"supervised_assessment_and_unsupervised_assessment_depending_on_whether_a_reference_image_is_needed": "Supervised assessment and unsupervised assessment are two categories of empirical assessment. Supervised assessment requires a reference image for evaluation, whereas unsupervised assessment does not require a reference image, relying instead on other criteria or methods for evaluation."},
