{"segmentation_algorithm": "The segmentation algorithm is a method used to divide an image into multiple segments or regions, typically to simplify or change the representation of an image for easier analysis.|Here is another description: The segmentation algorithm is a method or process used to divide an image into multiple segments or regions, typically for the purpose of simplifying or changing the representation of an image into something that is more meaningful and easier to analyze."},
