{"subjective_assessment__is__a_very_cumbersome_and_time_consuming_process": "The predicate 'is' in this context signifies the nature or characteristic of the subjective assessment process. It indicates that the process has a specific quality or attribute, which in this case is being cumbersome and time-consuming."},
