{"any_image_to_obtain_a_segmentation_result_graph": "\"Any image to obtain a segmentation result graph\" refers to the input and output of the segmentation process. The input is any given image, which could be a photograph, a scanned document, or a medical scan. The output is a segmentation result graph, which is a visual representation of the segmented image, showing the different regions or objects identified by the algorithm."},
