{"zagoruyko_and_komodakis": "Zagoruyko and Komodakis are researchers who have contributed to the field of image segmentation and evaluation, particularly through the use of convolutional neural networks (CNNs). Their work is part of a broader effort to improve the accuracy and efficiency of segmentation techniques."},
