{"cnn_based_effective_segmentation_evaluation_models": "CNN-based effective segmentation evaluation models refer to the use of Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) to evaluate the quality and effectiveness of image segmentation processes. These models aim to provide objective measures of segmentation performance, leveraging the deep learning capabilities of CNNs to analyze and assess segmentation results."},
