{"average_precision_ap__is_proposed_by__shan_2018": "The phrase \"is proposed by\" indicates the origin or authorship of the Average Precision (AP) metric. It signifies that AP was introduced or suggested by a specific individual or group in the context of evaluating object detection models."},
