{"precision_recall_for_regions__includes__pr_rr_and_fr": "The term \"includes\" in this context signifies that the precision-recall for regions framework encompasses specific metrics that are integral to its evaluation process. These metrics are essential components that contribute to the overall assessment of region-based segmentation performance."},
