{"levine_and_nazif_s_inter_class_contrast_inter": "Levine and Nazif\u2019s inter-class contrast (Inter) is a method used for evaluating image segmentation quality. It is part of a set of optimization criteria that assess various factors involved in defining segmentation, providing a dynamic reflection of segmentation status."},
