{"combination_of_intra_class_and_inter_class_disparity_intra_inter": "The Combination of intra-class and inter-class disparity (Intra-inter) is a method used in image segmentation evaluation that integrates both intra-class uniformity and inter-class contrast to assess segmentation quality."},
