{"objective_evaluation": "Objective evaluation refers to a method of assessing segmentation results that is not influenced by human factors, providing a more consistent and reliable assessment compared to subjective methods.|Here is another description: Objective evaluation refers to a method of assessing segmentation results that is impartial and accurate, relying on quantitative measures rather than subjective human judgment. It aims to provide a consistent and reliable assessment of segmentation quality."},
