{"an_evaluation_platform_for_evaluating_segmentation_algorithms_of_detecting_anatomical_structures_in_medical_images": "An evaluation platform for evaluating segmentation algorithms of detecting anatomical structures in medical images is a specialized tool designed to assess the performance of various algorithms used to segment and identify anatomical features within medical images, such as MRI or CT scans."},
