{"remote_sensing_images": "Remote sensing images, captured by satellites or aircraft, provide detailed visual data of the Earth's surface and atmosphere. They are essential for applications like environmental monitoring, resource management, urban planning, and disaster prevention, offering valuable information about inaccessible areas and aiding in the study of topography and land cover."},
