{"experiments__are_of__other_supervised_indicators": "The phrase \"are of\" indicates a classification or categorization of the experiments. It suggests that the experiments belong to a specific group or type, in this case, other supervised indicators."},
{"other_supervised_indicators": "Other supervised indicators are additional metrics or measures used in the experiments to assess performance. These indicators are part of a broader category of supervised learning metrics, which are used to evaluate the effectiveness of machine learning models."},
