{"accurate_judgments": "The object describes the outcome of applying the metrics, which is the making of accurate judgments. These judgments pertain to the effectiveness and correctness of the image segmentation results, as evaluated by the specified metrics."},
{"all_metrics": "All metrics refer to the various evaluation indicators used to assess the performance of image segmentation, including but not limited to Precision, Specificity, and Sensitivity."},
