{"b2_is_better_than_b3": "The object \"b2 is better than b3\" refers to the conclusion drawn from the application of the evaluation metrics, where segmentation result b2 is deemed superior to segmentation result b3 in the context of the experiment."},
{"evaluation_results_for_all_metrics_of_c2_and_c3": "The evaluation results for all metrics of c2 and c3 refer to the outcomes obtained from applying various evaluation metrics to the image segmentation results labeled as c2 and c3. These results are part of a comparative analysis aimed at assessing the effectiveness of different image segmentation methods."},
