{"automatic_selection_of_best_fit_parameters_for_a_given_image_segmentation_method": "Automatic selection of best-fit parameters for a given image segmentation method refers to the process of determining the optimal settings or configurations for an image segmentation algorithm. This involves choosing parameters that yield the best segmentation results for a particular image or set of images, based on the evaluation criteria."},
