{"natural_images_synthetic_images_medical_images_and_remote_sensing_images": "Natural images, synthetic images, medical images, and remote sensing images are various types of images that serve different purposes and are used in distinct fields. Natural images are photographs or visuals captured from the real world, synthetic images are computer-generated visuals, medical images are visuals obtained through medical imaging techniques, and remote sensing images are visuals captured from a distance, typically using satellites or aircraft."},
