{"assessments_where_accuracy_requirements_are_not_very_high_and_standard_images_are_difficult_to_obtain": "Assessments where accuracy requirements are not very high and standard images are difficult to obtain refer to situations in which the evaluation of image segmentation does not demand extreme precision, and acquiring reference or standard images for comparison is impractical or impossible."},
