{"analytical_methods__are_used_for__simple_evaluation_results_that_can_be_judged_with_the_naked_eye": "The phrase \"are used for\" indicates the purpose or application of analytical methods, highlighting their role in facilitating the assessment and interpretation of evaluation results."},
