{"the_segmentation_effect_that_humans_hope_to_achieve": "The segmentation effect that humans hope to achieve represents the ideal or desired outcome of an image segmentation process from a human perspective. This includes factors such as clarity, accuracy, and the meaningful separation of image components, which are crucial for practical applications and user satisfaction."},
