{"the_subjective_will_of_human_beings_to_the_greatest_extent": "The subjective will of human beings refers to the personal preferences, desires, or intentions that individuals have when evaluating image segmentation results. It encompasses the human element and the subjective judgments that people make when assessing the quality or effectiveness of segmentation algorithms."},
