{"cnn_based_segmentation_method": "The CNN-based segmentation method is a technique that utilizes Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) to perform image segmentation tasks. It involves training a CNN to recognize and delineate different regions or objects within an image, based on the input data and corresponding segmentation labels."},
