{"gt__represents__ground_truth": "The predicate \"represents\" indicates that _GT_ is used as a standard or reference point against which the quality and accuracy of segmentation results produced by various algorithms are measured."},
{"ground_truth": "Ground truth in image segmentation is the accurate and reliable segmentation of an image, serving as a benchmark to evaluate the performance of segmentation algorithms. It is typically obtained through manual segmentation by experts or other highly reliable methods."},
