{"various_fields": "Various fields encompass a broad range of applications where image segmentation is utilized, including but not limited to natural image processing, medical imaging, and remote sensing. Each of these fields has specific requirements and challenges that segmentation evaluation must address to ensure the segmented images are suitable for their intended use."},
