{"people__initially_rely_on__vision_to_evaluate_the_segmentation_results": "Initially rely on signifies the primary method or sense that people use when they first approach the task of evaluating segmentation results. This reliance indicates that vision is the foremost tool humans use before any other methods or tools are employed."},
{"vision_to_evaluate_the_segmentation_results": "Vision to evaluate the segmentation results refers to the use of human eyesight as the primary means to judge the quality and accuracy of image segmentation. This method is natural and intuitive for humans but can be influenced by various subjective factors and limitations."},
