{"many_effective_metrics_for_evaluating_image_segmentation": "Many effective metrics for evaluating image segmentation refer to a variety of quantitative measures and methods that researchers have developed to assess how well an image segmentation algorithm performs. These metrics fall into categories such as pixel-based, region-based, and distance-based evaluations, and they help in comparing segmentation results against a gold standard to improve accuracy and reliability."},
