{"normalized_probabilistic_rand_index_npr__is_an_improvement_to__previous_indicators": "The phrase \"is an improvement to\" indicates that the Normalized Probabilistic Rand index (NPR) represents an advancement or enhancement over earlier or existing evaluation indicators. This suggests that NPR offers better or more refined capabilities in assessing image segmentation algorithms compared to its predecessors."},
