{"the_segmentation_errors": "The segmentation errors are the inaccuracies or mistakes that occur during the process of image segmentation. In the context of the figure, these errors are categorized into four types: added region (blue), added background (green), border hole (yellow), and inside hole (purple). Each type is represented by a differently colored rectangle to distinguish it from the others."},
