{"added_region": "The \"added region\" is one of the four basic error types in Gelasca\u2019s segmentation error classification. It refers to an area that has been incorrectly included in the segmentation result, where it should not be present according to the ground truth. This error type is visually represented by the blue rectangle in the illustrations."},
