{"z__reaches_its_minimum_value__the_best_segmentation_result_can_be_obtained": "The phrase \"reaches its minimum value\" describes a condition where the variable _Z_ has attained its lowest possible value during the segmentation process. This condition is used as an indicator for optimal segmentation performance."},
