{"in_detail_and_separate_experiments": "\"In detail and separate experiments\" describes the manner in which the indicators with better performance are presented. This approach involves a thorough examination of each indicator through distinct experimental setups, allowing for a nuanced understanding of their application and effectiveness in evaluating image segmentation methods."},
