{"the_paper__demonstrates__the_validity_of_the_classic_and_commonly_used_supervised_and_unsupervised_indicators_on_different_types_of_images": "The predicate \"demonstrates\" indicates that the paper provides evidence or proof through experiments and detailed analysis to show the effectiveness and reliability of certain methods or indicators."},
{"the_validity_of_the_classic_and_commonly_used_supervised_and_unsupervised_indicators_on_different_types_of_images": "The validity of the classic and commonly used supervised and unsupervised indicators on different types of images refers to the effectiveness and reliability of traditional and widely adopted evaluation methods in various image processing tasks, as proven by the experiments detailed in the paper."},
