{"the_application_of_the_supervised_and_unsupervised_evaluation_methods_from_the_perspective_of_utilization": "The application of the supervised and unsupervised evaluation methods from the perspective of utilization refers to the practical use and effectiveness of these methods in real-world scenarios, as opposed to purely theoretical or comparative analysis."},
