{"qp_method": "The _Qp_ method is a technique used for image segmentation evaluation that involves combining multiple reference images to create a ground truth image. This method aims to improve the accuracy of segmentation evaluations by integrating the best parts of segmentations from various reference images.|Here is another description: The _Qp_ method is a technique used for constructing a ground truth image by integrating multiple reference images, enhancing the accuracy of segmentation evaluations.|Here is another description: The _Qp_ method is an approach used in the context of image segmentation experiments, specifically designed to evaluate the quality of segmentation results by comparing them against a reference."},
