{"applications": "Applications refer to the various uses and implementations of image segmentation evaluation methods in different contexts, such as comparing segmentation results, selecting parameters, or defining new segmentation methods.|Here is another description: Applications refer to the various uses and implementations of image segmentation evaluation methods in different contexts, such as medical imaging, natural image analysis, and remote sensing."},
