{"a_low_level_data_driven_evaluation_method_based_on_image_features": "A low-level data-driven evaluation method based on image features refers to an approach that uses basic, quantifiable image characteristics to assess segmentation quality. This method does not require high-level understanding or semantic information, making it more straightforward but potentially less accurate and versatile compared to methods that incorporate such advanced information."},
