{"simple_evaluation_results_that_can_be_judged_with_the_naked_eye": "Simple evaluation results that can be judged with the naked eye refer to outcomes or assessments of image segmentation that do not require complex tools or software to interpret. These results are straightforward enough to be evaluated by visual inspection alone, making them accessible and easy to understand without the need for advanced technology or expertise."},
